## Why This Is Asked
Demonstrates building a pluggable scheduling system where policies evolve without changing the core orchestrator. Focus on isolation, runtime extensibility, and safe concurrent access.

## Key Concepts
- Strategy pattern for interchangeable scheduling algorithms
- Registry pattern for runtime policy registration
